        "src/formats/sfnt/xx_sfnt.c",
        "src/formats/sfnt/xx_sfnt_extractor.c"
      ],
      "note": "Preserve all four reader flavors: TrueType 00010000, OTTO, true, typ1. TTC is a different format. Every supported flavor requires nonzero searchRange and zero entrySelector high byte (selector <= 11); these bounded tests disambiguate legacy numeric archive headers.",
